<title>NEW ZEALAND: Taylors yr net profit rises to $1.94 mln.</title>
<headline>Taylors yr net profit rises to $1.94 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  1.94 vs 1.30</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  2.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  8.0 vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				    28.8 vs 21.3</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				3.0 vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Tax					    1.1 vs 0.7</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  24.3 vs 24.3</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Note - Taylors Group Ltd is dry cleaning and laundry operator.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
